CharacterName,Morphling,变体精灵
ClassDescription,"A fluid DOTA2 hero who commands surging waves, shifts freely between Strength and Agility, empowers himself through Ebb & Flow, and morphs into foes.",来自 DOTA2 的水元素英雄：能化作波浪突进、自由转换力量与敏捷、凭先天技能「潮涨潮落」随属性动态强化移速/射程/施法距离/减速抗性，并可变形为敌人形态。
ClassName,morphling//female,变体精灵
ClassName,morphling//male,变体精灵
ClassName,morphling//non-binary,变体精灵
EntityDescription,"A sentient elemental forged from living tidewater, capable of reshaping its physical attributes at will.",由活水潮汐凝聚而成的智慧元素，能随心重塑自身的力量与敏捷形态。
EntityName,waterkin,变体水灵
ItemDescription,A condensed sphere of living tidewater launched as infinite ranged ammunition from a sling.,由活水潮汐凝聚的远程水弹，可作为弹弓无限弹药发射。
ItemName,tidal orb,潮汐水弹
PropertyDescription,Innate (Ebb & Flow): Agility grants bonus movement speed and ranged attack range; Strength grants bonus spell cast range and slow resistance. Persists while morphed.,先天技能「潮涨潮落」：敏捷提供额外移速与远程攻击距离；力量提供额外施法距离与减速抗性（变形期间持续保留）。
PropertyName,ebb and flow,潮涨潮落
RaceName,waterkin//female,变体水灵
RaceName,waterkin//male,变体水灵
RaceName,waterkin//non-binary,变体水灵
SpellDescription,"Assume the form of a targeted creature, copying its body, attributes, skills, and spells while retaining Ebb & Flow.",指向一名生物并化身为对方形态，复制其外形、属性、技能与法术，且先天技能「潮涨潮落」持续保留。
SpellDescription,Crush foes with a torrent of water that knocks them back and stuns them for a duration scaling dynamically with your Strength-to-Agility ratio (max stun at 1.5x Strength).,以重水洪流击退并眩晕目标，眩晕时长随当前力量/敏捷比值动态缩放（力量 ≥ 1.5 倍敏捷时达到最长眩晕）。
SpellDescription,"Dissolve into a surging wave, blinking forward, splashing water damage around you, and briefly gaining phasing and displacement.",化作汹涌波浪向前闪烁突进，对周围敌人造成水波范围伤害，并短暂获得穿墙与幻影闪避。
SpellDescription,Launch a surge of water dealing base damage plus bonus burst damage scaling dynamically with your Agility-to-Strength ratio (max scaling at 1.5x Agility).,发射高压水波造成基础水系伤害，并按当前敏捷/力量比值动态追加爆发伤害（敏捷 ≥ 1.5 倍力量时达到最高倍率）。
SpellDescription,Release your morphed form and immediately return to your true waterkin body.,解除当前变形状态，立即切回变体水灵本体。
SpellDescription,"Shift Agility into Strength and Constitution (1 to 5 points by mastery), conserving total stats while raising both maximum and current HP.",将敏捷转化为力量与体质（随变化系熟练度每次 1~5 点），总量守恒并同步提升最大生命与当前生命。
SpellDescription,"Shift Strength and Constitution into Agility (1 to 5 points by mastery), conserving total stats and lowering maximum HP without draining current HP.",将力量与体质转化为敏捷（随变化系熟练度每次 1~5 点），总量守恒并降低最大生命值，当前生命值仅在超过新上限时截断。
SpellName,adaptive strike agility,变体打击·敏捷
SpellName,adaptive strike strength,变体打击·力量
SpellName,morph,变形
SpellName,morph agility,属性转换·敏捷
SpellName,morph revert,解除变形
SpellName,morph strength,属性转换·力量
SpellName,waveform,波浪形态
